  "The banned-names list for tests/repo/r_ipscan.js (Release 1.0): third-party character, place, item and catchphrase names that must never appear in the game, the docs or the tests. DINGLECRAFT's cast is its own.",
  "ROT13-encoded so the repo passes its own scan: every letter a-z/A-Z is rotated by 13, except a letter right after a backslash (regex escapes such as \\b stay as they are). tests/lib/ipban.js decodes it.",
